	      </svg>
	      <span class="brand-name">Smart Second Brain</span>
	    </a>
	    {/* "Features" points at the first of the three pillar sections; they
	        run graph → search → agents from there, so one link covers the set. */}
	    <div class="nav-links">
	      <a href="#demo">How it works</a>
	      <a href="#graph-section">Features</a>
	      <a href="#privacy">Privacy</a>
	      <a href="#start">Install</a>
	<a href="/start/installation/">Docs</a>
	    </div>
	    <div class="nav-right">
	      <button
	        class="theme-tg"
	        type="button"
	        aria-label="Toggle dark and light theme"
	        aria-pressed="false"
	      >
