	            {/* Two consecutive read_content calls MERGE into one row
	                (buildMergedToolSummary): both targets resolve, so the label
	                lists them and the aggregate sums the lines. Two separate
	                "Read X, N lines" rows is what an unmerged pair would look
	                like, which the pane never renders. */}
